                            "text": " In this study, we report a promising method "
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "66",
                            "text": " for producing porous membranes that "
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "68",
                            "text": " are based "
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "66",
                            "text": " on MF but have capabilities for retaining viruses. The membranes "
                        },
